<title>GREECE: Greek Dec inflation drops to 7.5 pct yr/yr-source.</title>
<headline>Greek Dec inflation drops to 7.5 pct yr/yr-source.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's December consumer price inflation fell to 7.5 percet year-on-year from 7.7 percent in November, a governemnt source told Reuters.</p>
<p>An informal Reuters poll of bankers and economists on Tuesday produced a mean inflation forecast of 7.5 percent for December.</p>
<p>The official CPI inflation figure is expected to be released later today.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
